// - CLKHF_DIV parameter controls the internal divisor (00=48 MHz, 01=24 MHz, 10=12 MHz, 11=6 MHz).
// - Drive CLKHFEN=1 and CLKHFPU=1 to enable and power up the oscillator.
module top_dual_sevenseg (
